      "title": "API Request Rate by Pod",
      "description": "Which replicas the UI is actually reaching. A pod that is up and serving the API but receiving nothing points at the Service or its endpoints rather than at the application.\n\nExcludes OPTIONS, matching Request Rate by Route above, so the two panels count the same thing.",
